# Lobby

Own `app/page.tsx` and `components/shared/`. The portal line is in @cyber_playground_roadmap.md.

- `app/page.tsx` is the interactive portal: one card per experience listed in @cyber_playground_roadmap.md. The person's name on this page links to `/cv`. The page is not the CV.
- `components/shared/` holds the global shell, the floating back-to-lobby control, and the link to `/cv`.
- A project folder does not import another project folder.
- Route changes follow `.agents/skills/vercel-react-view-transitions/SKILL.md`.
